  list("Medium", "Trading sessions and pip / margin calculator (fx_fundamentals.R)",
       "Global trading sessions (GMT), pip value, margin and cross rates.",
       "Tag every trade with its session (Asia, London, New York, overlap) and show win rate and expectancy by session in 8. Statistics; warn when spreads are wide outside the main session.",
