  list("Medium", "Volume Profile, POC and Value Area, Market Profile, Initial Balance (Week 5)",
       "Volume and market profile levels and the initial balance of the session.",
       "Compute the previous session's POC, value-area high and low and today's initial balance from Capital.com candles; draw them on Market & Patterns and use them as stop and target anchors.",
       "Stops behind value-area edges and targets at the POC give levels the market actually respects."),
  list("Medium", "Moving Averages and MACD, Oscillators, Bollinger Bands, OBV (Week 3); ADX and DMI, Parabolic SAR (Week 6)",
